flowchart TD
    start([Start]) --> router[intake_router\nmini model / structured output]
    router -->|low confidence| escalate[escalate]
    router -->|out of scope| fallback[fallback]
    router -->|profile rewrite| profile[profile rewrite\ncoverage halt gate]
    router -->|outreach| outreach[read-only outreach guidance]
    router -->|authority / reach / comment| ground[ground\nread-only deterministic retrieval]
    ground -->|empty stories| escalate
    ground --> intel[fixed market brief\nauthority / reach only]
    intel --> write[write\nfull model]
    write --> gate[deterministic gate\nvoice + claims]
    gate -->|pass| hitl{{Human review interrupt}}
    gate -->|revise| critique[critic\ntargeted fixes]
    gate -->|block / indeterminate| escalate
    critique -->|under cap| write
    critique -->|over cap| escalate
    hitl -->|approve| commit[commit\nonly write: drafts/queue]
    hitl -->|edit| gate
    hitl -->|retry| write
    hitl -->|reject| end([End])
    hitl -->|escalate| escalate
    commit --> end
    profile --> end
    outreach --> end
    fallback --> end
    escalate --> end
